  "query": "what is ma huang tang",
  "response": "## Ma Huang Tang (麻黄汤)\n\n**Ma Huang Tang** [1] is a formula from the Shang Han Lun composed of **麻黄 (9g)**, **桂枝 (9g)**, **杏仁 (9g)**, and **甘草 (6g)** [1]. It is indicated for Tai Yang stage exterior cold patterns presenting with **no sweating, aversion to cold, fever, body aches, wheezing, and a floating tight pulse** [1]. Its functions are to release the exterior, promote perspiration, and relieve wheezing and coughing [1].",
